OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted of 27 sex offences,
OL,4,Aincluding rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of 27
OL,7,Fsexual offences against a woman and
OL,8,Fthree girls, including 10 counts of
OL,9,Frape.
OL,11,FJake Hardstaff, 35, from Boston,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, was convicted on Thursday
OL,13,Fat Lincoln Crown Court following a
OL,14,Ftwo-week trial.
OL,16,FHardstaff had pleaded not guilty to all
OL,17,Fthe allegations involving four separate
OL,18,Fvictims, one of whom was nine when the
OL,19,Fabuse started, according to police.
OL,21,FHe is due to be sentenced on 25
OL,22,FNovember.
